      {
        "id": "PoppyQ",
        "name": "Hammer Shock",
        "description": "Poppy swings her hammer, dealing damage and creating a zone that will slow enemies and explode after a delay.",
        "tooltip": "Poppy smashes the ground, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(30/55/80/105/130 + (75% bonus Attack Damage))</span> plus <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">7/7.5/8/8.5/9% max Health physical damage</span> and making the ground unstable. <br /><br />The unstable area <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> enemies by (20/23/26/29/32% + (0.008% bonus Health))and erupts after 1 second, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(30/55/80/105/130 + (75% bonus Attack Damage))</span> plus <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">7/7.5/8/8.5/9% max Health physical damage</span> again.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Percent Health damage deals a max of 85/120/155/190/225 damage to minions and jungle monsters per hit.</span>",
